{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261017/photo/bkn-20261017031057599-1017_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261017032840\"/><p>案發在淘大商場一梯間。</p><p>牛頭角發生行劫案。昨日(16日)晚上11時許，1名姓黃(22歲)女子報案，指於牛頭角道77號淘大商場一梯間被1名男子從後推跌，並劫去約1.1萬港元現金，賊匪其後向牛頭角道方向逃去。警員接報到場，經初步調查，案件列「行劫」，正追緝1名年約20至30歲男子，身高約1.7米，案發時身穿灰色長袖衞衣、深色長褲及戴口罩。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T19:37:40.644868+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T19:10:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T19:58:19.554171+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T19:36:05.986384+00:00","content_hash":"a437b22843cbd94024b1cb26198dfeb31c0c31026d1cfa76b12f1f65b9d3b4b7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}